# =============================================================================
# Source: templates/gitignore/texcache.gitignore
# Managed from the source file above.
# Comment out rules here if needed, but do not add or delete lines in this block.
# =============================================================================
# LuaLaTeX's luaotfload writes its font-names database into TEXMFCACHE, which
# defaults to a list of TDS trees under the TeX installation and $HOME.  Agent
# sandboxes and CI containers deny writes to all of them, so the first LuaLaTeX
# run aborts with
#   luaotfload-init.lua:301: system : no writeable cache path, quiting
# The Makefile and .latexmkrc therefore APPEND <repo>/.texcache to TEXMFCACHE
# when no default candidate is writable.  Regenerable — never commit.
.texcache/

